From: Kuan-Jui Chiu <kchiu@axiado.com>
Date: 2026-05-18 00:00:00
Subject: [PATCH] sysmgr: link against prebuilt libbali-hal-impl from sysroot

Drop the in-tree rebuild of bali-hal-impl (previously pulled in via
add_subdirectory of bali_hal/platform/ax-ultra) and declare it as a
CMake IMPORTED target that resolves to the static archive staged by
the bali-hal recipe at recipe-sysroot/usr/lib/bali-hal/libbali-hal-impl.a.

The base subtree is still entered directly so the kconfig step still
generates autoconf.h (consumed by sysmgr/src/openbic/* sources) and
libbase_hal.a remains available for linking.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Yocto packaging adaptation]
Signed-off-by: Kuan-Jui Chiu <kchiu@axiado.com>
---
 sysmgr/CMakeLists.txt | 18 +++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 17 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/sysmgr/CMakeLists.txt b/sysmgr/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/sysmgr/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/sysmgr/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -57,7 +57,23 @@ add_compile_definitions(
 set(COMPILE_ARG_FILE ${AXBASE_PATH}/r52-compile-args.cmake)
 include(${COMPILE_ARG_FILE})

-add_subdirectory("${BALI_PLATFORM_PATH}" "${CMAKE_BINARY_DIR}/bali_plat_build")
+# Build the base subtree directly so the kconfig step still produces
+# autoconf.h, which is included by sysmgr/src/openbic/* sources.
+add_subdirectory("${AXBASE_PATH}" "${CMAKE_BINARY_DIR}/axbuild")
+
+set(BALI_HAL_PREBUILT_DIR "${CMAKE_SYSROOT}/usr/lib/bali-hal"
+    CACHE PATH "Directory containing the prebuilt bali-hal-impl static library")
+set(BALI_HAL_IMPL_LIB "${BALI_HAL_PREBUILT_DIR}/libbali-hal-impl.a")
+if(NOT EXISTS "${BALI_HAL_IMPL_LIB}")
+    message(FATAL_ERROR
+        "Prebuilt bali-hal-impl not found at ${BALI_HAL_IMPL_LIB} - "
+        "is the bali-hal recipe staged into the sysroot?")
+endif()
+
+add_library(bali-hal-impl STATIC IMPORTED GLOBAL)
+set_target_properties(bali-hal-impl PROPERTIES
+    IMPORTED_LOCATION "${BALI_HAL_IMPL_LIB}"
+    INTERFACE_LINK_LIBRARIES base_hal)

 # Disable shadow warning only for ARM_CRx_MPU port.c
 set_source_files_properties(
